  "goodToKnow": "Der Auftakt is the start or prelude of something, often an event or series: der Auftakt der Bundesliga-Saison, zum Auftakt (to kick off). It's a favourite word of journalists. In music, der Auftakt is the upbeat, the note before the first full bar. Der Takt is the beat or bar, so Auftakt means the beat leading up. Ein gelungener Auftakt is a successful start."
